Well, the "standard semantics" of Lojban makes the referents of all 'lo bro=
da' expressions things in the operant sense,=A0 "the salient node in the up=
ward semilattice on the extension of {broda} under jest ) (part-whole)", so=
 anything between all the brodas and a microscopic speck of broda goo, as t=
he case requires.

The Nootka experience is directly relevant here, since what you got from se=
ntences were, in Lojban, merely complex selbri, not bridi at all for lack o=
f a=A0 sumti.=A0 Nootka is apparently a property or process language which =
can express complete sentences without a reference to things.=A0 Add it to =
the list.



